    <title id="bb-chain-title">Blackbox verification from behavioral contract to repair</title>
    <desc id="bb-chain-desc">
      A person approves a behavioral contract. A coding agent realizes it as a system test. One
      fresh attempt produces OpenTelemetry traces, effects, and a deterministic finding. An
      implementation repair returns to a fresh attempt. A contract change returns to a person.
    </desc>
